  "scope": "Independent static source and focused evidence audit of completed V91 shared mobile layout and Intrusul/Perechi recovery; no browser run or build by this auditor.",
  "source_review": [
    "App normal-flow notice row and independent scrollable screen viewport.",
    "GameShell measured sticky offset, ResizeObserver cleanup and full-title wrapping.",
    "Hud named group semantics, wrapping badges and removal of redundant scrolling tab stop.",
    "App-scoped CSS preserves package visuals and notice announcements; short-viewport sticky fallback and long-heading wrapping.",
    "Intrusul/Perechi current action, saved pointer and response identity checks; bounded failed-read snapshot with GET-only retry.",
    "Retry retains original saved-pointer claim so a removed pointer cannot revive an old terminal state.",
    "Owned 404 conditionally forgets only the matching pointer; changed ownership loads the current round.",
    "Presence layout effect and synchronous Exit invalidation suppress departure adoption; terminal score effect requires presence.",
    "Perechi queued focus binds game and pointer and is cleared at departure.",
    "Focused browser source uses real BFF commits with controlled transport failures and checks state, request counts, ownership, scoring and focus."
  ],
  "historical_distinctions": [
    "Paid clue persistence and the one-hint server cap predate V91.",
    "Actual unmount was already safe; the reproduced race occurs while departure animation keeps a screen mounted.",
    "Two initial Back non-reproductions remain historical observations; later four Back failures are preserved.",
    "Third-candidate exit 143 has an unestablished cause and its four failures are not treated as a green gate.",
    "Earlier mobile build is not claimed to equal the final rebuilt assets; unchanged shared source and final42 bindings are checked separately."
  ],
